            "solution_explanation": "Choice C is correct. MSUMC's long investment horizon allows them to consider \nholding illiquid private shares if they earn, on average, a higher return than public \nshare holdings.\nChoice A is incorrect as this feature is more relevant to MSUMC if they want to \nbe able to exert greater management control through equity ownership, and it is \nindependent of MSUMC's investment horizon.\nChoice B is incorrect as the disclosure requirements are also independent of \nMSUMC's investment horizon."
