            "solution_explanation": "C is correct because a focused strategy may employ either cost leadership or \ndifferentiation aimed at a specific group or product.\nA is incorrect because either cost leadership or differentiation can be the basis for \na focus strategy.\nB is incorrect because either cost leadership or differentiation can be the basis for \na focus strategy."
