            "options": {},
            "correct_answer": null,
            "solution_explanation": "The correct response is C. Panel data allows for analysis of how variables change \nover time for each entity while also comparing differences between entities.\nAlternative A is incorrect. Analyzing the same entity over multiple time periods \nwould be best accomplished using time-series data.\nAlternative B is incorrect. Analyzing multiple entities over the same time period \nwould be best accomplished using cross-sectional data."
