            "solution_explanation": "The correct response is B. The regression uses data collected over time for a \nsingle entity.\nAlternative A is incorrect: A panel regression involves multiple entities observed \nover time.\nAlternative C is incorrect: A cross-sectional regression involves multiple entities \nat a single point in time."
